# [x] Google Ads conversion + Enhanced Conversions (email/telefone)
# [x] UTMs + gclid/gbraid/wbraid/fbclid persistidos 90 dias (cookie first-party)
# [x] Thank-you page com Lead Pixel + Ads (todas as LPs solares)
# [x] CRM recebe gclid/fbclid/UTMs + bloco offline_conversion
# [ ] Preencher GOOGLE_ADS_ID + GOOGLE_ADS_CONVERSION_LABEL em produção
